{
 "name": "Animate Dead — lists only creature cards in graveyards until its trigger is fired",
 "notes": "Memory: project_animate_dead_graveyard_card_picker_2026-11-16. The attach picker of an Aura with 'Enchant creature card in a graveyard' listed creatures on the battlefield. While the Aura has that line it now lists the creature cards in every graveyard (_graveyardEnchantCandidates in cards-targeting.js; Battlefield.setGraveyardEnchant). Lightning Bolt in the graveyard and Grizzly Bears on the battlefield are not listed.",
